WEBVTT

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.760
(Laughter)

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.256
So I had no other choice.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:38.720
I decided I was going to make
the best quality Klan robes in America.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:45.296
These are not your traditional Klan robes
you would see at any KKK rally.

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.536
I used kente cloth,

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.856
I used camouflage,

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:53.960
spandex, burlap, silks,
satins and different patterns.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:58.256
I make them for different age groups;
I make them for young kids

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.880
as well as toddlers.